      "taskMessage": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Service identification is strongest when another analyst can repeat the check and observe the same product and version string. Record what TCP/8080 returns before interpreting it.",
      "taskInstructions": "Run <b>nmap -sV 10.42.18.73</b> in the terminal and type the product name and version shown on TCP/8080.",
      "taskQuestion": "What product and version does TCP/8080 report?",
